1
00:00:02,030 --> 00:00:04,495
Captain. The bank has taken the left
engine.

2
00:00:04,755 --> 00:00:05,629
Which one's the left?

3
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:07,238
The one that has stopped.

4
00:00:07,548 --> 00:00:11,244
And the navigation lights. And the
heating. And the coffee machine.

5
00:00:11,634 --> 00:00:13,010
They can't take the coffee machine.

6
00:00:13,269 --> 00:00:15,073
It was financed separately.

7
00:00:15,334 --> 00:00:18,743
Good morning! This is Temi in Recoveries.
Your vessel is being recovered.

8
00:00:19,103 --> 00:00:23,514
Full recovery, including the air, at six
tonight, lunar time. Please remain seated while–

9
00:00:23,464 --> 00:00:25,149
Temi! Hi! I'm about to make a payment–

10
00:00:26,359 --> 00:00:27,331
–we disable your–

11
00:00:27,281 --> 00:00:28,257
A big one. Enormous–

12
00:00:28,207 --> 00:00:30,406
Hello! You're speaking to Temi in
Recoveries!

13
00:00:30,666 --> 00:00:31,858
Why does she keep doing that?

14
00:00:32,118 --> 00:00:35,028
She is in Lagos. You are arguing with the
past.

15
00:00:35,419 --> 00:00:36,219
And I'm winning.

16
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:44,449
A job, posted to us directly. One parcel, sealed,
prepaid. Shackleton crater, by six tonight. The fee is–

17
00:00:44,399 --> 00:00:45,199
Is?

18
00:00:45,049 --> 00:00:47,301
Exactly what we owe. To the cent.

19
00:00:47,561 --> 00:00:48,361
Take it.

20
00:00:48,354 --> 00:00:49,564
You have not read the–

21
00:00:49,514 --> 00:00:50,811
Take it take it take it take it–

22
00:00:50,761 --> 00:00:54,787
Accepted. I am also filing a report on
you. Once is binding.

23
00:00:56,297 --> 00:00:57,734
Who sends a parcel to a crater?

24
00:00:57,994 --> 00:01:00,756
Someone who knew precisely how much we
owed.

25
00:01:01,016 --> 00:01:01,816
Lucky.

26
00:01:01,702 --> 00:01:03,503
Filed under "arithmetic".
